2.SUM ALL ARRAY ELEMENTS
You are given an array of integers. Return the sum of all the array elements.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public int arraySum(List<Integer> arr) {
                // code here
                int sum=0;
                for(int i=0;i<arr.size();i++){
                    sum+=arr.get(i);
                }
                return sum;
            }
        }
